/ Response to POST /pay. dom_id is the button region that was clicked.
/ A settled command (peek hit, or a re-click that deduped to a finished row)
/ resolves through the shared settled partial; otherwise the spinner + poller
/ take over.
- if command.settled?
  = render "servers/territories/pay_settled", command:, target: dom_id, current_server:, refreshed_territory:, refreshed_player:, retry_territory:
- else
  = turbo_stream.replace dom_id do
    = render "servers/territories/pay_processing", command:
